-- Washington v4 (2026-09-02): Crab Rules page verbatim (WDFW 2026-27 book,
-- page updated 2026-06-18). GENERATED via gen-wa-crab-v4.mts.
-- Insert-only + pack upsert to 4. Species appendix mirrors ontology additions.
